      budget: 9
      level: 1
      group: openrouter

    # --- level 1, the `*-review-ops` twins: `src/domain.operations/review/**` alone ---
    #
    # .note = each twin carries its base lane's rules, refs, and excludes verbatim; only
    #         the include changes, to the subtree its base now sheds (see `.SPLIT` above).
    #         the warmer trial pairs keep their arms: a twin of an OFF lane is OFF too.

    # 🔴 .note = the repo-rules pair timed out on fireworks at i009, both lanes — r001 at
